D329 10ACE4           (adybug/src/main.s):03145                 cmpy    ,s
D32C 25EF             (adybug/src/main.s):03146                 blo     btrow
D32E 3262             (adybug/src/main.s):03147                 leas    2,s
D330 35C0             (adybug/src/main.s):03148                 puls    u,pc
